{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "\"All Podcasts\" enables notifications for every podcast you're subscribed to. \"Let Me Choose\" keeps them off — turn on per podcast in Library → Podcast → Listening Profile." : {
      "comment" : "Message body of the confirmation dialog (action sheet) that appears when the user switches on New Episode Notifications; it explains the two buttons above it. The two quoted phrases are those buttons and must read exactly like their own translations, and 'Library -> Podcast -> Listening Profile' is a navigation path made of screen names that must match how those screens are translated. Full sentences, plenty of room.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„Alle Podcasts“ aktiviert Mitteilungen für jeden Podcast, den du abonniert hast. „Selbst auswählen“ lässt sie aus – schalte sie pro Podcast unter Mediathek → Podcast → Hörprofil ein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«Todos los podcasts» activa las notificaciones de todos los podcasts a los que estás suscrito. «Prefiero elegir» las deja desactivadas: puedes activarlas podcast a podcast en Biblioteca → Podcast → Perfil de escucha."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "« Tous les podcasts » active les notifications pour tous les podcasts auxquels vous êtes abonné. « Choisir moi-même » les laisse désactivées — activez-les podcast par podcast dans Bibliothèque → Podcast → Profil d'écoute."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Tutti i podcast\" attiva le notifiche per ogni podcast che segui. \"Scelgo io\" le lascia disattivate — attivale podcast per podcast in Libreria → Podcast → Profilo di ascolto."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Alle podcasts\" schakelt meldingen in voor elke podcast waarop je bent geabonneerd. \"Ik kies zelf\" houdt ze uit — zet ze per podcast aan via Bibliotheek → Podcast → Luisterprofiel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Clear Up Next\" removes upcoming episodes. \"Clear Everything\" also stops playback and removes the current episode." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the confirmation dialog for emptying the queue, shown only while an episode is playing; it explains the two destructive buttons above it. The quoted phrases are those button labels — translate them exactly as you translated the buttons 'Clear Up Next' and 'Clear Everything', and use your language's quotation marks. Up Next is the queue's screen name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„Als Nächstes leeren“ entfernt die kommenden Folgen. „Alles leeren“ stoppt außerdem die Wiedergabe und entfernt die aktuelle Folge."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«Vaciar A continuación» quita los episodios pendientes. «Vaciar todo» además detiene la reproducción y quita el episodio actual."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "« Vider À suivre » retire les épisodes à venir. « Tout effacer » arrête également la lecture et retire l'épisode en cours."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Svuota Prossimi\" rimuove i prossimi episodi. \"Svuota tutto\" interrompe anche la riproduzione e rimuove l'episodio corrente."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Wis wachtrij\" verwijdert de komende afleveringen. \"Wis alles\" stopt ook het afspelen en verwijdert de huidige aflevering."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@, %lld episodes, %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label for one row of the Top Podcasts ranking on the listening-stats screen; it replaces the row's visible text, so it is heard, never read. Argument 1 is the podcast (show) title, 2 the number of episodes listened to from that show, 3 the total listening time already formatted compactly such as '2h 30m'. The count has no plural rules in English — add them if your language needs them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%1$@, %2$lld Folge, %3$@"
                }
