    "%lld ep · %@" : {
      "comment" : "Caption line under a podcast title in the Top Podcasts list on the listening-history screen. Argument 1 is the number of episodes listened to, 2 the total listening time already formatted such as '2h 30m'. 'ep' is a deliberate abbreviation of 'episodes' because the row is one narrow line — keep the translation equally short. The '·' is a separator, not punctuation to translate.",
