    },
    "Accessibility Settings" : {
      "comment" : "Button in Settings -> Appearance that opens the system Settings app at its accessibility pane, plus the same text used as the button's VoiceOver label. It names Apple's own system screen, so use whatever wording Apple uses for it in this language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
