          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Note" : {
      "comment" : "Opens the editor for writing a personal, timestamped note attached to the current playback position. Appears as a button in the full player, an item in the mini-player overflow menu, a context-menu item on a chapter or transcript row, and as the title of the note sheet when creating (rather than editing) one. 'Note' is the noun: the user's own written remark.",
