    "Add time to the running sleep timer." : {
      "comment" : "Help sentence shown under the action name 'Extend Sleep Timer' when browsing YourPods actions in the Shortcuts app. The sleep timer is the countdown that pauses playback; this action adds minutes to one that is already counting down.",
      "localizations" : {
