    "Auto-hid %lld unplayed episodes. You can restore them from each podcast's detail page or from Settings → Auto-Hidden Episodes." : {
      "comment" : "Completion message in the sheet shown after the first auto-hide sweep, followed by a Done button. Past tense of 'to auto-hide' — the app has already hidden them. Plural rules handle the count; it counts episodes. 'Settings -> Auto-Hidden Episodes' is a navigation path whose names must match their own translations.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld ungespielte Folge wurde automatisch ausgeblendet. Du kannst sie auf der Detailseite des Podcasts oder unter Einstellungen → Automatisch ausgeblendete Folgen wiederherstellen."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
