    "Choose a Group" : {
      "comment" : "Section header in the sheet that moves several selected podcasts at once; the rows beneath it are the user's groups. Group = a user-made folder of podcasts (shows), not a queue and not a genre.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
