    "Connect to your own gPodder-compatible server — like Nextcloud gPodder Sync. Your data, your server, your rules." : {
      "comment" : "Body paragraph of the Nextcloud / self-hosted section on the About Account Types screen. gPodder, Nextcloud and 'Nextcloud gPodder Sync' (the name of the Nextcloud add-on) are never translated.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
