      "comment" : "VoiceOver label for the button that dismisses the Pro paywall and keeps the unpaid plan — heard, not read, so it spells out the product name the visible label omits. 'YourPods' is never translated and 'Free' is the name of the unpaid price tier, not the adjective.",
