    "Controls AirPods double/triple-tap and lock screen previous/next. Skip durations use your Playback settings above (%llds back, %llds forward)." : {
      "comment" : "Section footer under Headphone Controls. Argument 1 is the number of seconds a backward skip jumps, argument 2 the seconds a forward skip jumps; both are followed by a literal 's' for seconds. 'AirPods' is a product name and stays as-is; 'double/triple-tap' is the gesture on the AirPods stem.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steuert Doppel-/Dreifachtippen auf den AirPods sowie Vor/Zurück auf dem Sperrbildschirm. Die Sprungweiten stammen aus deinen Wiedergabeeinstellungen oben (%1$llds zurück, %2$llds vor)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Controls AirPods double/triple-tap and lock screen previous/next. Skip durations use your Playback settings above (%1$llds back, %2$llds forward)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Controla el doble y triple toque de los AirPods y los botones anterior/siguiente de la pantalla bloqueada. Los saltos usan los ajustes de Reproducción de arriba (%1$lld s atrás, %2$lld s adelante)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contrôle la double/triple pression sur les AirPods ainsi que les commandes précédent/suivant de l'écran verrouillé. Les durées de saut reprennent vos réglages de Lecture ci-dessus (%1$llds en arrière, %2$llds en avant)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Controlla il doppio/triplo tocco sugli AirPods e i tasti precedente/successivo sulla schermata di blocco. La durata dei salti segue le impostazioni di Riproduzione qui sopra (%1$llds indietro, %2$llds avanti)."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bepaalt wat dubbel/drievoudig tikken op de AirPods en vorige/volgende op het toegangsscherm doen. Voor overslaan gelden je afspeelinstellingen hierboven (%1$llds terug, %2$llds vooruit)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Convert to any sync mode anytime" : {
