    "Create a free account to sync subscriptions and listen positions across all your Apple devices. Just an email and password — no payment required." : {
      "comment" : "Body paragraph describing the YourPods Free account type on the About Account Types screen. 'Free' is the name of the unpaid tier; 'listen positions' means how far into each episode the user has played.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erstelle einen kostenlosen Account, um Abos und Hörpositionen auf all deinen Apple-Geräten zu synchronisieren. Nur E-Mail und Passwort – keine Zahlung erforderlich."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crea una cuenta gratuita para sincronizar las suscripciones y la posición de reproducción en todos tus dispositivos Apple. Solo un correo electrónico y una contraseña, sin necesidad de pagar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Créez un compte gratuit pour synchroniser vos abonnements et vos positions de lecture sur tous vos appareils Apple. Il suffit d'une adresse e-mail et d'un mot de passe — aucun paiement requis."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crea un account gratuito per sincronizzare iscrizioni e punti di ascolto su tutti i tuoi dispositivi Apple. Bastano un'email e una password — nessun pagamento richiesto."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maak een gratis account aan om abonnementen en luisterposities te synchroniseren op al je Apple-apparaten. Alleen een e-mailadres en wachtwoord — betalen hoeft niet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a free account to sync subscriptions and listen positions across devices — hosted by YourPods." : {
      "comment" : "One-line description under the YourPods Free Sync card. 'listen positions' = how far into each episode the user is. 'hosted by YourPods' = the servers are run by us. YourPods is a product name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erstelle ein kostenloses Konto, um Abos und Hörpositionen geräteübergreifend zu synchronisieren – gehostet von YourPods."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crea una cuenta gratis para sincronizar tus suscripciones y posiciones de escucha entre dispositivos, alojada en YourPods."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Créez un compte gratuit pour synchroniser vos abonnements et vos positions d'écoute sur tous vos appareils — hébergé par YourPods."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crea un account gratuito per sincronizzare iscrizioni e posizioni di ascolto tra i dispositivi — ospitato da YourPods."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maak een gratis account om abonnementen en luisterposities te synchroniseren tussen apparaten — gehost door YourPods."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a free account to sync your podcasts across devices." : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle under the onboarding title when the user is creating (rather than signing in to) a YourPods Sync account.",
      "localizations" : {
