    "Create a group first, then you can move podcasts into it." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the 'No Groups Yet' alert, shown when the user tries to file podcasts into a group before any group exists. Group = a user-made folder of podcasts (shows, not episodes).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erstelle zuerst eine Gruppe, dann kannst du Podcasts hineinverschieben."
