    "Glass Style" : {
      "comment" : "Picker label (and its VoiceOver label) choosing how translucent the app's own surfaces look on iOS 26. 'Glass' refers to Apple's Liquid Glass material, so prefer Apple's wording for it in this language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glas-Stil"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estilo Liquid Glass"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Style de verre"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stile Liquid Glass"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glasstijl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glass Style controls custom surfaces like the mini player and cards. System chrome (navigation bars, tabs) always follows the OS setting. Use Accessibility Settings to force reduced transparency system-wide." : {
      "comment" : "Section footer explaining the Glass Style picker. 'Glass Style' and 'Accessibility Settings' are the names of controls in this same screen and must match their own translations; 'system chrome' means the OS-drawn navigation bars and tab bars. A footer, so full sentences are fine.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glas-Stil steuert eigene Oberflächen wie den Mini-Player und Karten. Systemelemente (Navigationsleisten, Tabs) folgen immer der Einstellung des Betriebssystems. Verwende die Bedienungshilfen, um die Transparenz systemweit zu reduzieren."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estilo Liquid Glass controla las superficies propias de la app, como el minirreproductor y las tarjetas. Los elementos del sistema (barras de navegación, pestañas) siguen siempre el ajuste del sistema operativo. Usa los Ajustes de accesibilidad para reducir la transparencia en todo el sistema."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le réglage Style de verre s'applique aux surfaces personnalisées comme le mini-lecteur et les cartes. Les éléments système (barres de navigation, onglets) suivent toujours le réglage du système. Utilisez les Réglages d'accessibilité pour forcer la réduction de la transparence à l'échelle du système."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo stile Liquid Glass controlla le superfici personalizzate come il mini player e le schede. Gli elementi di sistema (barre di navigazione, tab) seguono sempre l'impostazione del sistema operativo. Usa Impostazioni Accessibilità per ridurre la trasparenza su tutto il sistema."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glasstijl bepaalt het uiterlijk van eigen oppervlakken zoals de mini-speler en kaarten. Systeemelementen (navigatiebalken, tabbladen) volgen altijd de instelling van het besturingssysteem. Gebruik Toegankelijkheidsinstellingen om de transparantie systeembreed te verminderen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Global Setting" : {
      "comment" : "Picker option appearing in one podcast's settings sheet meaning 'inherit whatever is set app-wide in Settings' rather than choosing a value for this show. A short picker row.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Globale Einstellung"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
