    "How Up Next Syncs" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the one-time info banner at the top of the Up Next tab that explains which account types sync the queue. 'Up Next' is the name of the play queue — translate it consistently with the standalone 'Up Next' string.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
