    "Listen position sync" : {
      "comment" : "Name of one feature in the Free-vs-Pro comparison table on the paywall; this one is included in both tiers. It means keeping the playback position within an episode in step across the user's devices, so a show resumes where it was left off. Keep it short — the feature-name column is narrow.",
      "localizations" : {
