            "value" : "Positiesynchronisatie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening Profile" : {
      "comment" : "Navigation title of the per-podcast settings sheet — YourPods' name for one podcast's own settings (AutoPilot, downloads, notifications, auto-hide). Several other strings point users to 'Library -> Podcast -> Listening Profile', so this translation must match those paths exactly.",
