    },
    "Listening Stats" : {
      "comment" : "Three roles: the Settings row that opens the listening-statistics screen, that screen's navigation title, and the name/type of the value the Shortcuts action returns (shown in Apple's Shortcuts app when building an automation). 'Stats' is short for statistics — minutes listened, episodes completed, streaks.",
