    "Loading episodes..." : {
      "comment" : "Spinner label while an episode list is being fetched — in the podcast preview sheet on iPhone, and on the watch while it waits for episodes from the phone. English uses three ASCII dots; use your language's normal ellipsis convention.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
