            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Markeer als afgespeeld en speel volgende af"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mark the current episode played and play the next" : {
      "comment" : "The sentence that forms the 'Mark Played and Play Next' action row in the Shortcuts editor. 'Played' = marked as finished; 'the next' is elliptical for the next episode in the queue.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktuelle Folge als gespielt markieren und die nächste abspielen"
