    },
    "Mark the current episode played and play the next one in your queue." : {
      "comment" : "Help sentence shown under the action name 'Mark Played and Play Next' in the Shortcuts app. Queue = the ordered list of episodes to play (Up Next on screen).",
      "localizations" : {
