    "Maximum episodes shown in the Recently Updated section on Home" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint on the Recently Updated Limit picker — heard, not read. 'Recently Updated' is a section on the Home screen and 'Home' the Home tab; both must match their own translations.",
