    "Notifications and badges are 100% local — nothing is sent to any server. Enable notifications per podcast in Library → Podcast → Listening Profile → Notifications." : {
      "comment" : "Section footer shown when both new-episode notifications and the app icon badge are on. '100% local' stresses that nothing is sent to a server. 'Library -> Podcast -> Listening Profile -> Notifications' is a navigation path whose names must match their own translations.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mitteilungen und Kurzhinweise sind zu 100 % lokal – nichts wird an einen Server gesendet. Aktiviere Mitteilungen pro Podcast unter Mediathek → Podcast → Hörprofil → Mitteilungen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las notificaciones y los globos son 100 % locales: no se envía nada a ningún servidor. Activa las notificaciones para cada podcast en Biblioteca → Podcast → Perfil de escucha → Notificaciones."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les notifications et les pastilles sont 100 % locales — rien n'est envoyé à un serveur. Activez les notifications podcast par podcast dans Bibliothèque → Podcast → Profil d'écoute → Notifications."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le notifiche e i badge sono 100% locali: non viene inviato nulla a nessun server. Attiva le notifiche per ogni podcast in Libreria → Podcast → Profilo di ascolto → Notifiche."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meldingen en badges zijn 100% lokaal — er wordt niets naar een server gestuurd. Schakel meldingen per podcast in via Bibliotheek → Podcast → Luisterprofiel → Meldingen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications are 100% local — nothing is sent to any server. Enable per podcast in Library → Podcast → Listening Profile → Notifications." : {
      "comment" : "Section footer shown when new-episode notifications are on but the app icon badge is off. '100% local' stresses that nothing is sent to a server. 'Library -> Podcast -> Listening Profile -> Notifications' is a navigation path whose names must match their own translations.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mitteilungen sind zu 100 % lokal – nichts wird an einen Server gesendet. Aktiviere sie pro Podcast unter Mediathek → Podcast → Hörprofil → Mitteilungen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las notificaciones son 100 % locales: no se envía nada a ningún servidor. Actívalas para cada podcast en Biblioteca → Podcast → Perfil de escucha → Notificaciones."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les notifications sont 100 % locales — rien n'est envoyé à un serveur. Activez-les podcast par podcast dans Bibliothèque → Podcast → Profil d'écoute → Notifications."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le notifiche sono 100% locali: non viene inviato nulla a nessun server. Attivale per ogni podcast in Libreria → Podcast → Profilo di ascolto → Notifiche."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meldingen zijn 100% lokaal — er wordt niets naar een server gestuurd. Schakel dit per podcast in via Bibliotheek → Podcast → Luisterprofiel → Meldingen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now Playing" : {
      "comment" : "The standard media term for what is playing right now. Used as a section header above the current episode on the home screen and in the Up Next queue screen, as the navigation title of the Apple Watch remote-control screen, and as the disabled label of the play button in episode details when that episode is already the one playing.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktuelle Wiedergabe"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reproduciendo ahora"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lecture en cours"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In riproduzione"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Speelt nu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Obsidian vault name for one-tap export. \"Daily Note\" mode requires the Advanced URI plugin in Obsidian.\n\nNextcloud: \"Notes App API\" syncs notes into the Nextcloud Notes app (requires the Notes app on your server). \"WebDAV\" writes .md files to the folder path above.\n\nAuto-sync pushes notes on each sync cycle when enabled." : {
      "comment" : "Long section footer under the Notes settings, shown to users with a gPodder/Nextcloud profile. The quoted names 'Daily Note', 'Notes App API' and 'WebDAV' are picker options on this same screen and must match their translations; Obsidian, Nextcloud, Advanced URI and WebDAV are product names. Keep the blank-line paragraph breaks.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Name des Obsidian-Vaults für den Export mit einem Tippen. Der Modus „Daily Note“ benötigt das Plug-in Advanced URI in Obsidian.\n\nNextcloud: „Notes App API“ synchronisiert Notizen in die Nextcloud-Notes-App (die Notes-App muss auf deinem Server installiert sein). „WebDAV“ schreibt .md-Dateien in den oben angegebenen Ordnerpfad.\n\nWenn Auto-Sync aktiviert ist, werden Notizen bei jedem Sync-Durchlauf übertragen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nombre de la bóveda de Obsidian para exportar con un toque. El modo «Daily Note» requiere el plugin Advanced URI en Obsidian.\n\nNextcloud: «Notes App API» sincroniza las notas con la app Nextcloud Notes (requiere la app Notes en tu servidor). «WebDAV» escribe archivos .md en la ruta de carpeta indicada arriba.\n\nLa sincronización automática envía las notas en cada ciclo de sincronización cuando está activada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nom du coffre Obsidian pour l'exportation en un geste. Le mode « Daily Note » nécessite le plug-in Advanced URI dans Obsidian.\n\nNextcloud : « Notes App API » synchronise les notes dans l'app Nextcloud Notes (nécessite l'app Notes sur votre serveur). « WebDAV » écrit des fichiers .md dans le dossier indiqué ci-dessus.\n\nLa synchronisation automatique envoie les notes à chaque cycle de synchronisation lorsqu'elle est activée."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nome del vault Obsidian per l'esportazione con un tocco. La modalità \"Daily Note\" richiede il plugin Advanced URI in Obsidian.\n\nNextcloud: \"Notes App API\" sincronizza le note nell'app Nextcloud Notes (richiede l'app Notes sul tuo server). \"WebDAV\" scrive file .md nel percorso della cartella indicato sopra.\n\nQuando è attiva, la sincronizzazione automatica invia le note a ogni ciclo di sincronizzazione."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Naam van de Obsidian-vault voor exporteren met één tik. De modus \"Daily Note\" vereist de Advanced URI-plug-in in Obsidian.\n\nNextcloud: \"Notes App API\" synchroniseert notities naar de Nextcloud Notes-app (vereist de Notes-app op je server). \"WebDAV\" schrijft .md-bestanden naar het mappad hierboven.\n\nAls automatische synchronisatie is ingeschakeld, worden notities bij elke synchronisatieronde verstuurd."
          }
        }
      }
    },
