    "Opens system accessibility settings to enable Reduce Transparency or Increase Contrast" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint on the Accessibility Settings button — heard, not read. 'Reduce Transparency' and 'Increase Contrast' are Apple's own system setting names, so use Apple's localized wording for them.",
