    "Recurred %lld times" : {
      "comment" : "Badge on a sync-conflict row showing how many times this same conflict has come back. Not a play count and nothing visual — the previous wording, 'Seen N times', read as a visual verb in an audio app. Argument 1 is the count.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
