                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recurring conflicts are usually caused by other podcast clients (e.g. gPodder) updating the same server. Each client writes its own position, causing repeated mismatches." : {
      "comment" : "Information banner at the top of the Sync Conflicts sheet, shown when the same conflict keeps reappearing. gPodder is a product name; 'position' means the playback position inside an episode.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wiederkehrende Konflikte entstehen meist dadurch, dass andere Podcast-Clients (z. B. gPodder) denselben Server aktualisieren. Jeder Client schreibt seine eigene Position, was zu wiederholten Abweichungen führt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los conflictos recurrentes suelen deberse a que otros clientes de podcasts (por ejemplo, gPodder) actualizan el mismo servidor. Cada cliente escribe su propia posición, lo que provoca discrepancias repetidas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les conflits récurrents sont généralement dus à d'autres clients de podcast (par ex. gPodder) qui mettent à jour le même serveur. Chaque client écrit sa propre position, ce qui provoque des divergences répétées."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I conflitti ricorrenti sono di solito causati da altri client podcast (ad es. gPodder) che aggiornano lo stesso server. Ogni client scrive la propria posizione, generando disallineamenti ripetuti."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terugkerende conflicten komen meestal doordat andere podcastclients (bijv. gPodder) dezelfde server bijwerken. Elke client schrijft zijn eigen positie weg, waardoor er steeds verschillen ontstaan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh & Sync" : {
      "comment" : "Quick Action button on the Home screen that reloads the podcast feeds and then runs a sync with the user's sync account. Two actions joined by '&'; the button is narrow — two of them share one row.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktualisieren & Sync"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Actualizar y sincronizar"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Actualiser et synchroniser"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aggiorna e sincronizza"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vernieuw en synchroniseer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh episode activity" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label for the toolbar button that re-fetches synced episode records from the gPodder server. 'Refresh' is the VERB (fetch again); it swaps to a 'Syncing…' label while the request is in flight. Heard, not read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folgenaktivität aktualisieren"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Actualizar la actividad de episodios"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Actualiser l'activité des épisodes"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aggiorna l'attività degli episodi"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vernieuw de afleveringsactiviteit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh your podcasts and sync, then report how many new episodes arrived." : {
      "comment" : "Help sentence shown under the action name 'Check for New Episodes' in the Shortcuts app. 'Sync' means syncing with the user's sync service (YourPods Pro, gPodder, etc.); the action then says how many new episodes were found.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktualisiert deine Podcasts, synchronisiert und meldet dann, wie viele neue Folgen eingetroffen sind."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Actualiza tus podcasts y sincroniza, y luego indica cuántos episodios nuevos han llegado."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Actualise vos podcasts, lance la synchronisation, puis indique combien de nouveaux épisodes sont arrivés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
