    "Report a translation issue" : {
      "comment" : "Link opening the support page in a browser, on the first-run sheet and permanently in Settings → Language & Translation. About a MISTRANSLATION in the app's interface, not a problem with a podcast or an audio file. Keep it short enough for one line in a settings row.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
