            "value" : "Start aflevering opnieuw"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restart the current episode" : {
      "comment" : "The sentence that forms the 'Restart Episode' action row in the Shortcuts editor. 'Restart' means play the same episode again from the beginning — it has nothing to do with restarting the app or the device.",
