    "Restore Purchase" : {
      "comment" : "Small text button on the YourPods Pro paywall that asks the App Store to reinstate a subscription the user has already bought. This is the standard App Store 'restore purchases' action — use the wording Apple's own storefront uses in your language. 'Restore' is the verb, 'Purchase' the noun.",
