    "Search Details" : {
      "comment" : "Label (and VoiceOver label) of a small toggle chip in the Library's filter row that extends the search to episode descriptions, not just titles. Read it as 'also search the descriptions' — it does NOT mean 'details about the search'. It is a small pill, so keep it short.",
      "localizations" : {
