    "Set a sleep timer for ${minutes} minutes" : {
      "comment" : "The sentence that forms the 'Set Sleep Timer' action row in the Shortcuts editor. ${minutes} is an inline token that must stay EXACTLY as written and may be moved for word order; the trailing 'minutes' is the unit word with no plural rules, so pick a form that works for any count.",
