    "P3 removes tracking redirects, not ads. Many podcasts stitch ads directly into the audio file, and P3 does not change that." : {
      "comment" : "Detail under the 'Not an Ad Blocker' row. 'stitch ads directly into the audio file' means the ads are baked into the recording itself, so there is nothing in the URL left to remove. P3 is a product feature name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "P3 entfernt Tracking-Weiterleitungen, keine Werbung. Viele Podcasts fügen Werbung direkt in die Audiodatei ein, und daran ändert P3 nichts."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
