    "Sync via community-run gPodder-compatible services like gpodder.net. Your subscriptions and listen progress sync across any app that speaks the gPodder protocol." : {
      "comment" : "Body paragraph for the third-party section of the About Account Types screen. gPodder and gpodder.net are names; 'listen progress' means how far into episodes the user has played.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Synchronisiere über gPodder-kompatible Dienste, die von der Community betrieben werden, etwa gpodder.net. Deine Abos und dein Hörfortschritt werden mit jeder App synchronisiert, die das gPodder-Protokoll spricht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sincroniza mediante servicios compatibles con gPodder gestionados por la comunidad, como gpodder.net. Tus suscripciones y tu progreso de escucha se sincronizan entre todas las apps que hablan el protocolo gPodder."
