            "value" : "Synchroniseren…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncs subscriptions and episode listen positions across all your devices through infrastructure you control." : {
      "comment" : "Caption under the Nextcloud / self-hosted description on the About Account Types screen. 'Listen positions' means how far into each episode the user has played; 'infrastructure you control' means the user's own server.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Synchronisiert Abos und Hörpositionen von Folgen über all deine Geräte hinweg – über eine Infrastruktur, die du selbst kontrollierst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sincroniza las suscripciones y las posiciones de escucha de los episodios entre todos tus dispositivos a través de una infraestructura que tú controlas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Synchronise vos abonnements et vos positions d'écoute sur tous vos appareils via une infrastructure que vous contrôlez."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sincronizza le iscrizioni e le posizioni di ascolto degli episodi su tutti i tuoi dispositivi tramite un'infrastruttura che controlli tu."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Synchroniseert abonnementen en luisterposities van afleveringen op al je apparaten, via infrastructuur die je zelf beheert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System" : {
      "comment" : "Picker option in the Appearance picker: follow whatever light/dark setting iOS itself uses. Use the wording Apple uses for the automatic/system option; a compact picker row beside 'Light' and 'Dark'.",
