            "value" : "Alleen tekst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app icon shows the number of unplayed episodes across all your subscriptions." : {
      "comment" : "Section footer shown when the app icon badge is on but new-episode notifications are off. Describes the number drawn on the Home Screen icon. A footer, so a full sentence is fine.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das App-Symbol zeigt die Anzahl der ungespielten Folgen aus allen deinen Abos."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El icono de la app muestra el número de episodios sin reproducir de todas tus suscripciones."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'icône de l'app affiche le nombre d'épisodes non lus de tous vos abonnements."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'icona dell'app mostra il numero di episodi non riprodotti di tutte le tue iscrizioni."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het appsymbool toont het aantal niet-afgespeelde afleveringen van al je abonnementen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The episode or podcast couldn't be loaded. It may have moved or the link may be invalid." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the alert titled 'Couldn't open this share', shown when a shared yourpods:// link cannot be resolved. 'Link' is the noun — the URL that was tapped.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Folge oder der Podcast konnte nicht geladen werden. Möglicherweise wurde sie verschoben oder der Link ist ungültig."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se ha podido cargar el episodio o el podcast. Puede que se haya movido o que el enlace no sea válido."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossible de charger l'épisode ou le podcast. Il a peut-être été déplacé ou le lien n'est plus valide."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non è stato possibile caricare l'episodio o il podcast. Potrebbe essere stato spostato oppure il link potrebbe non essere valido."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De aflevering of podcast kon niet worden geladen. Mogelijk is die verplaatst of is de link ongeldig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The full cloud experience. Web player, cross-device queue sync, listening stats, annotations, gPodder bridge, and media proxy." : {
      "comment" : "Body paragraph describing YourPods Pro on the About Account Types screen. 'Web player', 'gPodder bridge' and 'media proxy' are feature names of the paid tier.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das volle Cloud-Erlebnis. Web-Player, geräteübergreifender Sync der Warteliste, Hörstatistiken, Anmerkungen, gPodder-Bridge und Media-Proxy."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La experiencia completa en la nube. Reproductor web, sincronización de la cola entre dispositivos, estadísticas de escucha, anotaciones, puente gPodder y proxy multimedia."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'expérience cloud complète. Lecteur web, synchronisation de la file d'attente entre appareils, statistiques d'écoute, annotations, passerelle gPodder et proxy multimédia."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'esperienza cloud completa. Player web, sincronizzazione della coda tra dispositivi, statistiche di ascolto, annotazioni, bridge gPodder e proxy media."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De volledige cloudervaring. Webspeler, wachtrijsynchronisatie tussen apparaten, luisterstatistieken, annotaties, gPodder-bridge en mediaproxy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The premium podcast player." : {
      "comment" : "One-line positioning statement under the app name on the welcome page. 'Premium' describes quality here — it is not the name of a paid tier.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Premium-Podcast-Player."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El reproductor de podcasts premium."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le lecteur de podcasts haut de gamme."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il player di podcast premium."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De premium podcastspeler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen YourPods opens to on launch" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint on the Start Page picker — heard, not read. 'YourPods' is the app name and is never translated.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Bildschirm, mit dem YourPods startet"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La pantalla que YourPods abre al iniciarse"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'écran affiché par YourPods au lancement"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La schermata che YourPods apre all'avvio"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het scherm dat YourPods opent bij het starten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server has rewritten these feed URLs. Accept to update locally, or keep your current URLs." : {
      "comment" : "Intro text above the feed-URL conflicts in the Sync Conflicts sheet. 'Accept' names the Accept button on each row and 'keep' points at the 'Keep Local' button — use the same words you used for those buttons.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Server hat diese Feed-URLs geändert. Wähle „Übernehmen“, um sie lokal zu aktualisieren, oder behalte deine aktuellen URLs."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El servidor ha reescrito estas URL de feeds. Toca Aceptar para actualizarlas localmente o Mantener local para conservar tus URL actuales."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le serveur a réécrit ces URL de flux. Acceptez pour les mettre à jour localement, ou conservez vos URL actuelles."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il server ha riscritto questi URL dei feed. Accetta per aggiornarli in locale oppure mantieni i tuoi URL attuali."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De server heeft deze feed-URL's herschreven. Accepteer om ze lokaal bij te werken, of behoud je huidige URL's."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The third-party service's privacy policy applies — YourPods itself stores nothing from these accounts." : {
      "comment" : "Caption under the third-party gPodder section of the About Account Types screen, making clear that YourPods holds no data for such accounts.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es gilt die Datenschutzerklärung des Drittanbieters – YourPods selbst speichert nichts aus diesen Accounts."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se aplica la política de privacidad del servicio de terceros — YourPods no guarda nada de estas cuentas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La politique de confidentialité du service tiers s'applique — YourPods ne conserve rien de ces comptes."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si applica l'informativa sulla privacy del servizio di terze parti — YourPods non memorizza nulla di questi account."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het privacybeleid van de dienst van derden is van toepassing — YourPods zelf bewaart niets van deze accounts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-Party gPodder Services" : {
