    "Tracking redirects will be stripped from episode URLs for all podcasts.\n\nYou can override this for individual podcasts in Library → Podcast → Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the alert shown right after P3 is switched on. Explains that tracking redirects are stripped from episode URLs, and where to override it. 'Library -> Podcast -> Settings' is a navigation path whose names must match their own translations; keep the blank-line paragraph break.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tracking-Weiterleitungen werden bei allen Podcasts aus den Folgen-URLs entfernt.\n\nFür einzelne Podcasts kannst du das unter Mediathek → Podcast → Einstellungen ändern."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se eliminarán las redirecciones de seguimiento de las URL de los episodios de todos los podcasts.\n\nPuedes cambiar esto para podcasts concretos en Biblioteca → Podcast → Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les redirections de suivi seront retirées des URL des épisodes pour tous les podcasts.\n\nVous pouvez modifier ce réglage podcast par podcast dans Bibliothèque → Podcast → Réglages."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I redirect di tracciamento verranno rimossi dagli URL degli episodi per tutti i podcast.\n\nPuoi modificare questa scelta per i singoli podcast in Libreria → Podcast → Impostazioni."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
