      "comment" : "Section footer in Settings → Feed Management, shown while auto-hide is on. The rule is the episode's PUBLICATION date, not how long it has sat unplayed — an old episode you never opened is hidden regardless of when you last used the app. Argument 1 counts days; plural rules handle it. A footer, so a full sentence is fine.",
